kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "architecture-core"
purpose: "定义 Crystalith v2 前后端基础结构约束：feature-sliced 布局、依赖方向、统一路由入口与出站 HTTP 代理合约。只覆盖结构与边界，不覆盖业务语义。"
valid_scope[2]: apps/,packages/
requirements[7]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,"Backend follows feature-sliced layout","后端 MUST 按 feature 切片组织 HTTP 路由，每个业务域 MUST 有清晰的路由入口；跨域共享逻辑 MUST 放置在共享层（shared/ai/rag/db 等），MUST NOT 在多个 feature 内重复实现。"
  r2,"Dependency direction is one-way","`features` MUST NOT 依赖 web 应用层；`shared` MUST NOT 依赖 `features`。仅类型标注可在 `import type` / 等价边界中例外。"
  r3,Router aggregation is centralized,所有后端路由 MUST 在统一入口（createApp 或等价）聚合挂载，避免多入口隐式依赖链。
  r4,"Frontend workspace is domain-sliced","前端工作区 MUST 按 domain 切片组织，每个 domain MUST 有可独立装配的入口。"
  r5,Frontend app/shared boundaries stay thin,"`apps/web/src/app` 仅负责入口装配；跨 domain 复用 MUST 放到共享层（apps/web/src/shared 或 features/workspace/shared）。"
  r6,Workspace state uses sliced Zustand stores,"复杂工作区状态 MUST 按 slice 组织并通过 selector 访问，避免全局重渲染与循环依赖。"
  r_outbound_http,Non-LLM outbound HTTP uses unified proxy-aware client,"非 LLM 出站 HTTP（搜索、URL 抓取、网页抽取、同类中间件）MUST 经统一代理感知的出站客户端（outboundFetch 或等价 helper）发出，并读取全局 `proxy_settings`：enabled=false 时 MUST 直连；enabled=true 时 MUST 对未命中 no_proxy 的目标注入 HTTP(S) 代理。socks5_url MAY 保留于配置但本阶段 MUST 忽略。MUST NOT 在这些路径直接调用全局 `fetch` 绕过代理合约。AI SDK / LLM / embedding provider 路径本阶段不受此约束。"
scenarios[10]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,"add-a-new-backend-feature","","开发者新增一个后端 feature","该 feature SHALL 有独立的路由入口，共享逻辑不得重复散落"
  r2,"import-layering-is-enforced","","代码引入了跨层依赖（如 `shared` 导入 `features`）","系统 SHALL 视为违规并要求修正"
  r3,"register-a-new-route","","开发者增加一个新的 API 路由","路由 SHALL 在统一入口聚合注册"
  r4,"add-a-new-frontend-domain","","新增一个 UI domain","代码 SHALL 放置在对应 domain 切片内"
  r5,"place-cross-feature-ui-reuse","","需要跨 feature 复用组件或工具","复用代码 SHALL 放入共享层而非在 feature 内复制"
  r6,"add-a-new-workspace-state-slice","","UI 需要新增一类复杂的工作区状态","状态 SHALL 以 slice 组织并通过 selector 访问"
  r_outbound_http,"new-non-llm-http-client","","开发者新增非 LLM 出站 HTTP 调用","实现 SHALL 经统一出站客户端或已包装 helper，而非裸 fetch"
  r_outbound_http,"disabled-is-direct","proxy_settings.enabled=false","调用出站客户端请求 https://example.com","结果 SHALL 为直连（不注入代理）"
  r_outbound_http,"no_proxy_skips","proxy_settings.enabled=true 且 no_proxy 含 localhost","请求 http://127.0.0.1:8080/search","结果 SHALL 为直连"
  r_outbound_http,"https_uses_https_url","proxy_settings.enabled=true 且 https_url 非空","请求 https://api.firecrawl.dev/v2/scrape","请求 SHALL 使用该 https_url 作为代理"
